rt.owl:270051:SubClassOf(<https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_993> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_10090>))\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270052:SubClassOf(<https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_993> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_500>))\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270054:# Class: <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> (brain)\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270056:AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000028> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"root\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270057:AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"http://atlas.brain-map.org/atlas?atlas=1#structure=997\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270058:AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"http://atlas.brain-map.org/atlas?atlas=2#structure=997\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270059:AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"http://atlas.brain-map.org/atlas?atlas=602630314#structure=997\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270060:AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"root\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270061:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"brain\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:270062:AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> <https://purl.brain-bican.org/ontology/mbao/MBA_997> \"brain  ( mouse )\")\nsrc/ontology/imports/merged_import.o